# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of platform. Windows runners
# default to `core.autocrlf=true` which rewrites LF → CRLF at checkout; Biome
# is configured with `"lineEnding": "lf"` and fails every text file. Setting
# `eol=lf` at the repository level is the standard fix — see
# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes#_end_of_line_conversion.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats that must not be text-normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Lockfile is generated and rewriting whitespace here would defeat cache hits.
pnpm-lock.yaml -text
